  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1a3b65f9e03152942904a7929e282231, type: 3}
  m_Name: Campaign_TinyWar
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PaperWings.Gameplay.CampaignSettings
  version: 1
  id: tinywar
  displayName: Tiny War
  tagline: A war film. In a house. Over one weekend.
  rosterTitle: "TINY WAR \xB7 ORDER OF BATTLE"
  levelWord: Level
  briefingWord: WAR DIARY
  comingSoon: []
  completeLine: THE WAR IS OVER. TEA?
  starBonus: 0a00000019000000
  nights:
  - title: Ration Run
    memo: WAR DIARY, Friday. Mum and Dad are gone till Sunday. Grandad is in charge
      (asleep in his chair). The fort under the table needs supplies. Three of my
      couriers are flying cookies from the jar to the fort, one at a time. Maya's
      Red raiders will try to shoot them down. Stay close. Two have to get through.
      We can lose one cookie, NOT two. Biscuit is asleep on the window seat. Do NOT
      wake her up.
    mode: 2
    room: 5
    place: 'Kitchen: the cookie jar to the fort'
    area: 
    spawn: FridgeSpawn
    objective: 2
    group: CookieRun
    allowedLosses: 2
    aceName: 
    killTarget: 2
    maxRivals: 1
    timeLimit: 0
    airTimeTarget: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    rivalPilot: {fileID: 0}
    twoStarTime: 120
    threeStarTime: 85
    when: "FRIDAY \xB7 1900"
    newsreel: 'Friday night. The grown-ups have gone. The house falls silent... and
      in the kitchen, the Blue Wing prepares for war.


      Supplies must get through
      to the fort. Every cookie counts.'
    catAwake: 0
    rewardClips: 70
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: Battle of the Kitchen
    memo: WAR DIARY, Friday, later. Maya wants the kitchen. She's sent her whole
      Red Squadron in. Shoot down four. Hide behind the cereal boxes, climb in the
      toaster heat and the kettle steam. Biscuit is AWAKE and in a playful mood.
      She goes for anything flying low, Red or Blue. Stay high.
    mode: 2
    room: 5
    place: 'Kitchen: over the counter'
    area: 
    spawn: TableSpawn
    objective: 0
    group: 
    allowedLosses: 2
    aceName: 
    killTarget: 4
    maxRivals: 2
    timeLimit: 0
    airTimeTarget: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    rivalPilot: {fileID: 0}
    twoStarTime: 110
    threeStarTime: 75
    when: "FRIDAY \xB7 2030"
    newsreel: 'Twenty-thirty hours. Red Squadron crosses the counter in force.


      Above
      the toaster, the skies fill with paper. Below, a cat watches. She has chosen
      no side. She never will.'
    catAwake: 1
    rewardClips: 90
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: The Dreadnought
    memo: 'WAR DIARY, Friday, 10 o''clock. The robot vacuum WOKE UP. It''s on a timer,
      and Maya taped a cardboard turret on it. Now it patrols the floor sucking in
      anything low and firing crumbs. We call it THE DREADNOUGHT. Shoot off its side
      brushes so it can''t suck as hard. When its battery runs low it goes home to
      charge: its dust bin pops open. HIT THE DUST BIN. Biscuit is terrified of it.
      So am I.'
    mode: 3
    room: 5
    place: 'Kitchen: the floor'
    area: 
    spawn: TableSpawn
    objective: 0
    group: 
    allowedLosses: 2
    aceName: 
    killTarget: 0
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 0
    airTimeTarget: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    rivalPilot: {fileID: 0}
    twoStarTime: 190
    threeStarTime: 130
    when: "FRIDAY \xB7 2200"
    newsreel: 'Twenty-two hundred hours. Without warning, the Dreadnought leaves
      its dock.


      It answers to no one. It devours everything in its path.
      Tonight, the kitchen floor belongs to the machine.'
    catAwake: 0
    rewardClips: 200
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: Bathtub Landing Day
    memo: 'WAR DIARY, Saturday, early. Sam''s Green Gang took the bathroom while
      we slept. Today we land. Fly the rings: through the shower steam, over the
      bath and the rubber-duck navy, up the extractor fan and round the hot towel
      rail. Steam lifts you but makes your paper soggy. The fan sucks you UP: use
      it.'
    mode: 1
    room: 6
    place: 'Bathroom: the beachhead'
    area: 
    spawn: 
    objective: 0
    group: 
    allowedLosses: 2
    aceName: 
    killTarget: 0
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 0
    airTimeTarget: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    rivalPilot: {fileID: 0}
    twoStarTime: 60
    threeStarTime: 44
    when: "SATURDAY \xB7 0700"
    newsreel: 'Saturday, oh-seven-hundred hours. Fog over the bathtub.


      Somewhere
      in the steam, the rubber-duck navy lies in wait. The Blue Wing goes in at dawn.'
    catAwake: 0
    rewardClips: 90
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: Soap Convoy
    memo: 'WAR DIARY, Saturday, breakfast. Sam''s couriers (green) are flying soap-bar
      ammo from the bath along the towel rail to his toilet-roll castle on the sink.
      Shoot down five before three get through. One of his crayon planes flies cover.
      Mind the taps: they DRIP, and wet paper flies like a wet sock.'
    mode: 2
    room: 6
    place: 'Bathroom: the towel rail'
    area: 
    spawn: 
    objective: 1
    group: SoapConvoy
    allowedLosses: 3
    aceName: 
    killTarget: 5
    maxRivals: 1
    timeLimit: 0
    airTimeTarget: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    rivalPilot: {fileID: 0}
    twoStarTime: 100
    threeStarTime: 70
    when: "SATURDAY \xB7 0830"
    newsreel: 'Oh-eight-thirty. A supply line runs along the towel rail.


      Soap.
      Enough soap to hold the bathroom for a week. It must not reach the castle.'
    catAwake: 0
    rewardClips: 110
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: The Typhoon
    memo: 'WAR DIARY, Saturday, 10 o''clock. Sam has a SECRET WEAPON. He taped Mum''s
      hairdryer to his monster truck. Hot blasts throw you up, cold blasts shove
      you back, and it fires soap bubbles. Shoot the tape straps off so it can''t
      aim. When it overheats it cuts out: shoot the SWITCH on the handle. Don''t
      tell Mum.'
    mode: 3
    room: 6
    place: 'Bathroom: the floor'
    area: 
    spawn: 
    objective: 0
    group: 
    allowedLosses: 2
    aceName: 
    killTarget: 0
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 0
    airTimeTarget: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    rivalPilot: {fileID: 0}
    twoStarTime: 190
    threeStarTime: 130
    when: "SATURDAY \xB7 1000"
    newsreel: 'Ten hundred hours. A roar from the bathroom.


      The Green Gang
      has unleashed the Typhoon: hot wind, cold wind, and bubbles. Nothing can stand
      in its path. The Blue Wing must try.'
    catAwake: 0
    rewardClips: 220
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: Lights Out
    memo: 'WAR DIARY, Saturday night. Mum said lights out and Sam''s Green Gang took
      the bedroom in the dark. We fly by the glow of the fairy lights. The LAVA LAMP
      is a fat warm thermal, the radiator under the window lifts you, and the ceiling
      fan chops down on whatever flies under it. Learn where the shadows are: you''ll
      need them.'
    mode: 1
    room: 7
    place: 'Bedroom: under the fairy lights'
    area: 
    spawn: 
    objective: 0
    group: 
    allowedLosses: 2
    aceName: 
    killTarget: 0
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 0
    airTimeTarget: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    rivalPilot: {fileID: 0}
    twoStarTime: 62
    threeStarTime: 46
    when: "SATURDAY \xB7 2100"
    newsreel: 'Saturday, twenty-one hundred hours. The house goes quiet.


      Somewhere
      upstairs a nightlight clicks on. The Blue Wing flies by fairy light.'
    catAwake: 0
    rewardClips: 110
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: Pillow Fort
    memo: 'WAR DIARY, Saturday, late. Our medics (blue) have to get from the toy
      box to the pillow fort under the window. Sam''s crayon planes will hunt them
      down wherever they fly, so don''t wait for the fight to come to you: fly the
      route with them and shoot whatever chases. Three through, and we hold the fort.'
    mode: 2
    room: 7
    place: 'Bedroom: the toy box to the fort'
    area: 
    spawn: 
    objective: 2
    group: FortConvoy
    allowedLosses: 2
    aceName: 
    killTarget: 3
    maxRivals: 2
    timeLimit: 0
    airTimeTarget: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    rivalPilot: {fileID: 0}
    twoStarTime: 125
    threeStarTime: 90
    when: "SATURDAY \xB7 2200"
    newsreel: 'Twenty-two hundred hours. Under the window, a fort of pillows and
      a duvet.


      It is all that stands between the Blue Wing and a long night.
      The medics fly at midnight.'
    catAwake: 0
    rewardClips: 140
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: The Top Bunk
    memo: 'WAR DIARY, Saturday, midnight. Sam has bolted his gooseneck desk lamp
      to the top bunk and turned it into a SEARCHLIGHT. If the beam finds you it
      shoots, and when it locks on it shoots a lot. Hide behind the pillow fort,
      the wardrobe and the bed frame. Shoot off the three hinge bolts to slow its
      head. When it overheats, the shade flips up: shoot the BULB.'
    mode: 3
    room: 7
    place: 'Bedroom: Sam''s bunk'
    area: 
    spawn: 
    objective: 0
    group: 
    allowedLosses: 2
    aceName: 
    killTarget: 0
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 0
    airTimeTarget: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    rivalPilot: {fileID: 0}
    twoStarTime: 200
    threeStarTime: 140
    when: "SATURDAY \xB7 2359"
    newsreel: 'Midnight. One light is still on.


      Sam''s Night Watch sweeps
      the bedroom, and nothing that flies is safe in its beam. The Blue Wing will
      have to fight in the dark.'
    catAwake: 0
    rewardClips: 260
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: Ceasefire
    memo: 'WAR DIARY, Sunday morning. Maya came down the stairs and said it out loud:
      the Green Gang is getting out of hand. Red and Blue are flying TOGETHER today.
      Two wingmen fly with you against Sam''s whole squadron: nine kills between
      you. The fireplace is a thermal as big as a lift. Mum is about to start tidying:
      when she turns the vacuum on, climb out of its suction.'
    mode: 4
    room: 8
    place: 'Living room: the sofa'
    area: 
    spawn: 
    objective: 0
    group: 
    allowedLosses: 2
    aceName: 
    killTarget: 9
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 0
    airTimeTarget: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    rivalPilot: {fileID: 0}
    twoStarTime: 140
    threeStarTime: 100
    when: "SUNDAY \xB7 0800"
    newsreel: 'Sunday, oh-eight-hundred hours. A truce is declared on the sofa.


      Red
      and Blue, side by side, for the first time since Friday. Nobody expects it
      to last.'
    catAwake: 0
    rewardClips: 150
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: The Cleanup
    memo: 'WAR DIARY, Sunday, mid-morning. Mum says the house is a state and she
      is going to tidy it. All of it. Nobody is shooting today: just stay in the
      AIR for 55 seconds in one flight. Her vacuum sucks everything toward the nozzle,
      and the front door gust will push you across the room. Ride the fireplace,
      hug the ceiling, do not land on the rug.'
    mode: 0
    room: 8
    place: 'Living room: Mum''s tidy-up'
    area: 
    spawn: 
    objective: 0
    group: 
    allowedLosses: 2
    aceName: 
    killTarget: 0
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 0
    airTimeTarget: 55
    windScale: 1.25
    noPencils: 0
    rivalPilot: {fileID: 0}
    twoStarTime: 75
    threeStarTime: 60
    when: "SUNDAY \xB7 1000"
    newsreel: 'Ten hundred hours. The hoover comes out of the cupboard.


      It
      is the one enemy both armies fear. Stay in the air, or be swept away.'
    catAwake: 0
    rewardClips: 170
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: The Kaiju
    memo: 'WAR DIARY, Sunday, lunchtime. Maya and Sam stopped shouting long enough
      to build something together: a giant out of cereal boxes. It stomps, and every
      footfall sends a shockwave along the floor, so fly HIGH. Shoot off its shoulder
      bolts to stop its fists. When it staggers its chest hatch flaps open: shoot
      the FUSE. Then everybody has to go and eat their lunch.'
    mode: 3
    room: 8
    place: 'Living room: the rug'
    area: 
    spawn: 
    objective: 0
    group: 
    allowedLosses: 2
    aceName: 
    killTarget: 0
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 0
    airTimeTarget: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    rivalPilot: {fileID: 0}
    twoStarTime: 210
    threeStarTime: 150
    when: "SUNDAY \xB7 1200"
    newsreel: 'Twelve hundred hours. On the living-room rug, something stands up.


      Two
      armies have built one monster. Tonight, the Blue Wing must bring it down, and
      then everyone goes in for tea.'
    catAwake: 0
    rewardClips: 350
    rewardUnlockId: 
